						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >What you grow is who you become.<br>Farmer’s Daily is a farming survivor roguelite. Your fields are where your power comes from: which crops you plant and how much you harvest decide what kind of farmer you become each run.<br>Crops are your abilities</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >25 crops, each hiding its own ability that levels up the more you harvest</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Pick a different mix of crops every run</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >The scent of your crops lures monsters in: the more you grow, the more come<br>Farm tools are your weapons</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >30 auto-attacking weapons, and every one of them can evolve</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Enchantments, 11 passives and 46 artifacts work with your crop abilities, so every run plays differently</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >5 kinds of drones collect, water, plant, harvest and defend for you<br>A colorful cast of monsters</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >30 minions, 65 elites and 65 bosses, every boss with moves of its own<br>30-minute runs, stronger every time</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >32 farmers, each with a different starting weapon and traits</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >64 permanent Farmhouse upgrades: build up your farm bit by bit with Season Seeds</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Easy, Normal, Hard and Hell difficulties, plus Endless mode once you win</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >97 achievements<br>About the art<br>This game has no artist. Every character, crop and monster is drawn by code, one stroke at a time. If it looks a little crooked and a little weird, that’s the style. Probably.<br>Available in 12 languages: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese (Brazil), Russian and Polish.</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
